  VERDICT
  -> The model beats ensemble spread on the honest metric, and the
     whole confidence interval is above zero.

  NOTE: accuracy is deliberately not reported anywhere. At a ~5% base
  rate, predicting 'never a bust' scores 95% and is useless.

